# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large / regenerable artifacts (kept out of git to keep the repo lean).
# Everything below is reproducible with:  python -m src.generate_reports
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Trained model binary (large, regenerable)
models/*.joblib

# Processed/cleaned dataset (regenerable from data/raw)
data/processed/*.csv

# NOTE: the following are intentionally KEPT in git for portfolio value, since
# they are small and let visitors see results without running the pipeline:
#   - data/raw/ ............. the public IBM Telco dataset
#   - reports/visualisations/ generated charts (EDA, ROC, SHAP, etc.)
#   - reports/analysis_summary.json and models/*.json metrics/metadata
